        702.0,
        1410.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "(Johnson and Kotz 1970a, p. 83). The quantity within brackets gives the fraction of phenotypic variance remaining after selection, $ \\sigma_{s}^{2}/\\sigma^{2} $ (Figure 2.4).",
